      "Q": {
        "slot": "Q",
        "id": "IreliaQ",
        "name": "Bladesurge",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Irelia dashes forward to strike her target, healing herself. If the target is Marked or dies to Bladesurge, its cooldown refreshes.",
        "bodyHtml": "Irelia dashes to an enemy, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(5/25/45/65/85 + ([[si:scalead]]80% Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> and restoring <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">([[si:scalead]]9/10/11/12/13% Attack Damage) Health</span> to herself. If the enemy dies or was <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Unsteady</span>, the Cooldown is refreshed.<br /><br />Deals (55/75/95/115/135 + ([[si:scalead]]80% Attack Damage)) damage to minions.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">This ability applies On-Hit Effects.</span>",
