      "W": {
        "slot": "W",
        "id": "IreliaW",
        "name": "Defiant Dance",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Irelia charges a strike that deals more damage as she charges. She takes reduced physical damage during the charge.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span>Begin Charging:</span> Irelia enters a defensive stance for up to 1.5 seconds, becoming unable to act but reducing physical damage taken by ((40 ~ 70) + ([[si:scaleap]]8% Ability Power))and magic damage taken by ((20 ~ 35) + (4% Ability Power)).<br /><br /><span>Release:</span> Irelia lashes out with her blades, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(10/20/30/40/50 + ([[si:scalead]]40% Attack Damage) + ([[si:scaleap]]50% Ability Power)) physical damage</span> increased up to <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(30/60/90/120/150 + ([[si:scalead]]120% Attack Damage) + ([[si:scaleap]]150% Ability Power))</span> based on charge time.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">The <span>Release</span> will happen automatically at the end of the <span>Charge</span> and cannot be interrupted. Reaches max damage increase after 0.75 seconds.</span>",
