      "E": {
        "slot": "E",
        "id": "IreliaE",
        "name": "Flawless Duet",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Irelia sends out two blades which converge on each other. Enemies caught in between are damaged, stunned and Marked.",
        "bodyHtml": "Irelia throws a blade into the ground and can <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> for up to 3.5 seconds. <br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast:</span> Irelia throws a second blade, then they fly towards each other <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stunning</span> for 0.75 seconds and dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(70/110/150/190/230 + ([[si:scaleap]]100% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>. Champions and large jungle monsters become <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Unsteady</span> for 5 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Irelia will automatically <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> at her location after 3.5 seconds.</span>",
